  "scope": "Original monitor initialization and stop; exact-hash private application patch, no peer-protocol or service-readiness acceptance. No runtime thread/futex/signal change.",
  "original_failure": {
    "elf_sha256": "a099d2b3ebc77bfe1393bec3543a41ba8c20c99d0abc26619241d31964dea6d7",
    "command": [
      "python",
      "build/run_monitor_probe.py",
      "--diag"
    ],
    "probe": "build/probes/20261114T010528361889Z/monitor",
    "exit_code": 125,
    "exception": "access violation at 0x08050422; CUdpHandler this==NULL",
    "lifecycle": [
      "SIGTERM delivered once to main guest thread",
      "CThreadInterface::stop at 0x0805aa8e, called from 0x0806406a",
      "CUdpNetworkThread destructor at 0x08097238 called before its worker exit; no join call",
      "UDP worker tid 3736 faults in RecvFromClient; caller 0x08097446"
    ],
    "log": {
      "path": "build\\probes\\20261114T010528361889Z\\monitor\\stderr.log",
      "sha256": "bee8cfe644b403ea8b5f4e47ae0d06ddce009464cf4bb4c19fbac82d191417de"
    }
  },
  "root_cause": [
    "Original CApplication::Free clears the UDP running flag and deletes the object without joining the worker.",
    "UDP dispatch sets running=true after a 5-second startup sleep, overwriting earlier stop.",
    "Joining alone blocks on the UDP blocking recvfrom. Closing the receiving socket first releases the Windows wait."
  ],
  "fix": [
    "Set the running flag before pthread_create; remove the later UDP flag overwrite.",
    "On shutdown clear running, close and invalidate the UDP receiving fd, join the worker, then delete its object.",
    "Keep original file length and virtual addresses; validate original hash and every old byte, write only a private copy. Original ELF is the recovery path."
  ],
  "diagnostic_ordering": {
    "probe": "build/probes/20261114T011248792617Z/monitor",
    "trace": [
      "main tid 13692 calls join",
      "futex WAIT on child clear_tid with expected tid 4564",
      "worker tid 4564 exits and clears clear_tid",
      "main futex returns 0",
      "UDP destructor executes after the wait returns"
    ],
    "log": {
      "path": "build\\probes\\20261114T011248792617Z\\monitor\\stderr.log",
      "sha256": "c54b83aa9681001974cc6f52fb8bfef073e7274f293886bc61c88567972b431c"
    }
  },
